  "native_operator_contract": {
    "layer": "Eight pre-norm layers, each LayerNorm eps1e-5 learned weight+bias, bias-free QKV [1536,512] and attention output [512,512], learned per-channel layer_scale_1, residual, LayerNorm2 eps1e-5, bias-free FFN linear1 [2048,512], default F.gelu, bias-free linear2 [512,2048], learned layer_scale_2, residual. No gating.",
    "ring_cache": "Each attention layer has K/V ring [2,B,8,250,64]; one two-token call first writes both K/V at (old_end+arange(2))%250, then advances end by2 and computes positions for all physical slots; mask uses pos_k>=0, pos_q-pos_k>=0 and <250. Attention offsets advance after SDPA. Cache and offsets reset at new stream.",
